===Noun===
{{en-noun|numerologies}}

# The study of the [[purported]] [[mystical]] relationship between a count or measurement of physical objects and their living parts.  An organizational subset of a system of physical objects has a numerical operation done to it that starts with a number but does not output a number, but the output is the (abstract) [[character]] of an arrangement, or the output is some (spiritual) ideation-action of the life, not a number.


